WEBVTT

00:31.240 --> 00:35.950
C'mon, let's see you sweat! Keep it up!

00:52.720 --> 00:54.010
Come again!

00:58.870 --> 01:01.330
SHUTTLE BUS

00:58.870 --> 01:01.330
TOBU
BUS

00:58.870 --> 01:01.330
HIGH-SPEED
BUS

01:03.910 --> 01:06.750
TO OJI STATION

01:06.750 --> 01:09.710
TO NIIGATA
STATION
ARRIVING
SHORTLY

01:39.680 --> 01:41.810
We arrive at Niigata Station...

01:42.180 --> 01:43.730
5:00 a.m. tomorrow morning.

01:44.350 --> 01:45.350
Um...

01:45.350 --> 01:46.230
Yes?!

01:47.400 --> 01:49.190
That's my seat.

01:51.610 --> 01:52.570
Oh!

01:52.570 --> 01:53.490
Ow...

01:54.030 --> 01:59.410
I'm very sorry. My mistake!

02:00.890 --> 02:05.890
Star Rain

02:12.000 --> 02:13.840
That was delicious.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.630
Say...

02:15.880 --> 02:17.630
Care for some dessert after your meal?

02:18.510 --> 02:20.100
M-macarons!

02:20.930 --> 02:22.760
Y-you don't mind?

02:22.760 --> 02:24.220
Please, go ahead.

02:24.470 --> 02:29.230
Well then, I accept your offer. Thank you very much.

02:34.110 --> 02:35.570
Delicious!

02:35.780 --> 02:37.860
On vacation? Or visiting home?

02:38.160 --> 02:43.540
Oh, vacation. Though, I guess it's
not much of a vacation.

02:43.870 --> 02:47.210
More of a "life study" or a learning experience, I suppose.

02:47.460 --> 02:48.500
You're alone?

02:48.500 --> 02:49.250
Yes.

02:49.250 --> 02:50.080
A student?

02:50.330 --> 02:54.210
Yes, that's right. Um, are you on vacation?

02:55.800 --> 02:59.090
I'm going home. Also... to confirm.

02:59.380 --> 03:01.140
Um, to confirm?

03:02.050 --> 03:03.810
Have some more, if you like.

03:03.810 --> 03:06.560
Oh, no, I couldn't possibly—

03:06.560 --> 03:09.690
Please, go on! I'm already full.

03:10.270 --> 03:11.860
You can have them all.

03:12.440 --> 03:18.110
W-well, if that's the case...
I'll be glad to eat these for you.

03:31.710 --> 03:33.840
Let's see...

03:38.010 --> 03:40.880
Fine! You don't have to come!

03:41.590 --> 03:43.220
Forget it!

04:17.090 --> 04:18.090
Wake up.

04:19.090 --> 04:20.550
Come on, wake up!

04:22.180 --> 04:24.180
Would you get up already?

04:26.640 --> 04:28.600
Good morning...

04:29.100 --> 04:30.060
Goodnight.

04:30.060 --> 04:30.850
Huh?!
Goodnight.

04:30.850 --> 04:31.560
Come on!

04:32.270 --> 04:34.520
Wake up! We're in Niigata!

04:49.830 --> 04:55.420
Hey! You actually travel alone when
it's this hard for you to wake up?

04:56.250 --> 04:59.090
I-I'm very sorry.

04:59.710 --> 05:01.210
You okay on your own?

05:01.210 --> 05:03.840
Yes, I think I'll be fine!

05:04.680 --> 05:05.800
I'm worried.

05:06.390 --> 05:14.690
I'm fine. Um, thank you for everything.
The macarons were very tasty!

05:14.890 --> 05:17.980
Sure. Well, see you. Take care.

05:18.570 --> 05:19.320
Ma'am!

05:49.260 --> 05:53.180
6:48. I still have more than an hour.

06:11.580 --> 06:12.450
Excuse me.

06:13.200 --> 06:15.870
Say, excuse me! Hey, Miss!

06:17.420 --> 06:20.090
The train's here. You're getting on, right?

06:20.540 --> 06:25.050
Ah! Yes! I-I'm getting on!

06:25.760 --> 06:27.050
Please hurry!

06:28.220 --> 06:29.010
Hey!

06:30.350 --> 06:31.470
You dropped this.

06:31.470 --> 06:32.390
Ah!

06:33.010 --> 06:35.480
Sorry. Thank you very much.

06:54.370 --> 06:55.540
A nice breeze...

06:56.580 --> 07:02.250
And the sky is so wide.
Does everyone around here feel this way?

07:08.050 --> 07:11.050
Look, the wind tells me.

07:12.550 --> 07:16.470
They seem to drift, seem to roll...

07:18.020 --> 07:21.650
The pages run out, stacked one atop another.

07:33.280 --> 07:37.040
So that we'll meet. So that we'll find each other.

07:38.460 --> 07:40.250
The scenery drifting past the window....

07:41.500 --> 07:47.420
It may look lonesome, but let's set out without hesitation.

08:02.210 --> 08:02.750
Urban
Sightseeing
Map

08:04.810 --> 08:09.360
I thought there'd be a place to eat since
the Limited Express stopped here...

08:11.530 --> 08:13.320
I'll find something if I walk around.

08:21.060 --> 08:25.560
The
Original     Soba                 HARIE

08:23.040 --> 08:25.340
Well, it's still early...

08:31.630 --> 08:32.630
Rain?!

08:41.520 --> 08:43.140
That was way too sudden.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.590
GRANDMA
KITAMURA
SUZU
MANAGER
YUMI
EMI

09:00.330 --> 09:02.750
Um, the entrance is on the other side.

09:03.790 --> 09:08.250
Ah! No, I was just ducking out of the rain. S-sorry!

09:09.880 --> 09:13.550
Oh, I'm sorry. I thought you were here for the tour.

09:15.300 --> 09:19.680
Well, as long as you're here,
why not come inside and relax?

09:20.640 --> 09:22.890
But, I don't want to be a bother...

09:29.070 --> 09:31.110
I've got snacks, if you like.

09:37.410 --> 09:38.320
Come in.

09:39.160 --> 09:41.080
Thank you very much!

09:48.290 --> 09:51.380
Here you go. Hang it up over there, please.

09:51.670 --> 09:53.590
Ah, thank you very much.

09:54.090 --> 09:57.090
So, what brings you to Tainai all by yourself?

09:58.390 --> 09:59.720
"Tainai"?

09:59.720 --> 10:03.640
The name of this place.
Tainai City, Niigata Prefecture.

10:03.980 --> 10:12.400
O-oh, I see. Well, I came here mainly
because I wanted to head north.

10:12.400 --> 10:18.110
So I got on the night bus to Niigata,
and have been playing it by ear since then.

10:19.370 --> 10:25.330
That's a pretty wild trip to take alone.
But there's not much to see around here.

10:26.000 --> 10:28.580
The only place I can think of is the hot springs.

10:28.580 --> 10:31.420
Hot springs! How wonderful!

10:32.210 --> 10:34.760
Well then, I'll tell you where it is later.

10:34.760 --> 10:36.550
Thank you very much.

10:48.140 --> 10:51.190
Um, do you mind if I take a picture?

10:51.440 --> 10:52.520
Go ahead.

10:52.520 --> 10:54.110
Thank you very much!

10:58.450 --> 11:00.280
Would you like to try it?

11:01.410 --> 11:02.990
B-but, I...!

11:02.990 --> 11:08.710
You'll do fine. I can show you the basics.
You can make simple accessories in no time.

11:09.290 --> 11:12.670
Besides, it's boring to just watch, right?

11:34.980 --> 11:36.320
All done!

11:38.360 --> 11:39.820
You can have it, if you like.

11:40.110 --> 11:42.490
Huh? Are you sure?

11:42.490 --> 11:45.160
Well, of course. To remember today.

11:51.330 --> 11:53.790
The rain's stopped, huh?

11:55.590 --> 11:56.380
Yes!

12:04.140 --> 12:08.060
The bus stops near the Tainai Hot Springs,
but it's still a good walk.

12:08.640 --> 12:12.190
Not to worry. I'm feeling energetic!

12:12.190 --> 12:17.150
There aren't many places to eat on the way,
so you should get something around here first.

12:17.150 --> 12:24.530
Okay. Um, thank you for everything.
I'll treasure this glass bead!

12:27.080 --> 12:28.160
Take care.

12:28.450 --> 12:30.960
Okay. Off I go!

13:08.700 --> 13:11.330
Straight down Route 53...

13:15.120 --> 13:16.130
Okay!

13:44.720 --> 13:46.820
Urban
Sightseeing
Map

15:22.860 --> 15:26.690
SUZU-YA

15:23.750 --> 15:25.880
I... I made it!

15:28.550 --> 15:29.550
Um!

15:31.800 --> 15:33.050
Are you all right?!

15:33.600 --> 15:40.350
Y-yes. I don't have a reservation,
but is it possible to get a room?

15:40.900 --> 15:44.860
Yes, no problem. Let me get your bag.

15:45.400 --> 15:47.940
Th-thank you very much.

15:51.610 --> 15:54.580
You've come a long way. Welcome.

15:54.580 --> 15:56.450
Thank you very much.

15:56.950 --> 15:58.450
Did you take a taxi out here?

15:58.450 --> 16:01.210
No, I walked from the bus stop.

16:01.210 --> 16:04.340
Walked? That must have been awful!

16:05.250 --> 16:08.300
It wore me out, but I enjoyed it.

16:08.590 --> 16:14.470
We have many guests staying with us tonight,
but please take as long as you like in the springs.

16:15.300 --> 16:18.430
Okay! I'll do just that.

16:38.790 --> 16:45.380
Good for nerves, muscle pain,
joint pain, fatigue, and so on.

16:46.170 --> 16:47.380
I see!

17:15.280 --> 17:19.290
Hey, Mom! When do we go to the observatory?

17:20.490 --> 17:22.410
Once we've eaten dinner.

17:23.620 --> 17:25.670
You think we'll see a shooting star?

17:25.670 --> 17:26.330
Yes.

17:28.150 --> 17:30.800
STAR FESTIVAL

17:28.150 --> 17:30.800
Free Admission

17:33.820 --> 17:36.700
Free Admission

17:33.840 --> 17:37.910
STAR FESTIVAL

17:36.530 --> 17:37.910
Welcome to the world of the stars

17:53.860 --> 17:57.240
Let's set out, without hesitation.

18:02.870 --> 18:04.120
Okay!

18:13.590 --> 18:16.430
Go halfway and take a right.

18:24.430 --> 18:30.900
M-maybe this was a bit reckless...
But if I go straight, I should get there. Yeah!

18:34.780 --> 18:42.410
The path's gone. But why? Did I go too far?

18:50.040 --> 18:51.290
No service.

18:52.380 --> 18:54.170
If I head straight back...

18:54.270 --> 18:56.230
Beware of bears
Niigata Prefecture

18:58.590 --> 19:03.100
It's so dark that I missed the fork...

19:54.400 --> 19:55.610
Mr. Raccoon Dog!

21:55.060 --> 21:58.900
Nani ga atta toshitemo
No matter what happens

21:59.360 --> 22:03.360
Wasurezu ni iru koto
There's something you shouldn't forget

22:03.820 --> 22:07.570
"Daremo ga hitori ja nai"
"No one is ever alone"

22:07.780 --> 22:11.200
Donna basho ni itemo
No matter where you are

22:12.830 --> 22:16.710
Mado nagareru keshiki
The scenery drifting past the window

22:17.170 --> 22:21.130
Samishiku mietemo
May look lonesome

22:21.550 --> 22:25.220
Mayowazu arukidasou
But let's set out, without hesitation

22:25.470 --> 22:28.930
Meguriau mirai ni
Toward the future where we'll meet

22:29.470 --> 22:31.930
Hora, kaze ga tsugeru
Look, the wind tells me

22:32.560 --> 22:34.270
"Sugu soko da yo"
"It's right over there"

22:34.600 --> 22:38.440
Hashiridasu kasaneta PAGE
The pages run out, stacked one atop another

22:38.940 --> 22:40.900
Hoshi to hoshi to o
From star to star

22:41.190 --> 22:43.150
Sen de musubu
Connecting them with lines

22:43.820 --> 22:47.570
Marude bokura no you
Just like us

22:47.780 --> 22:51.280
So I want to shine like a star

22:52.160 --> 22:55.580
So I want to shine like a star

22:56.120 --> 22:59.750
Koko ni iru mirai
The future that's right here

22:59.960 --> 23:01.750
Terashite yuku
Is illuminated

23:04.920 --> 23:06.260
Hoshi furu
Stars rain down

23:08.880 --> 23:10.720
Ooki no sora
In a giant sky

23:13.720 --> 23:15.850
Hoshi furu
Stars rain down

23:17.680 --> 23:20.150
Ooki no sora
In a giant sky

23:25.000 --> 23:40.020
Next Episode Preview

23:26.360 --> 23:28.700
The "locked-room mystery" is mere fiction.

23:29.150 --> 23:32.530
The trap that is common sense simply
brings the case to a standstill.

23:33.600 --> 23:40.020
The Super Sonico Murder Case

23:33.740 --> 23:36.330
Next time, "The Super Sonico Murder Case"!

23:36.790 --> 23:39.210
This has been the famous detective Ena Fujimi.
